.TH HIMVOTE 1 "October 2026" "HimVote 1.0" "HimVote User Manual"
.SH NAME
himvote \- Institutional verifiable election client and offline audit explorer for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B himvote
[\fB\-\-api\-base\fR \fIURL\fR]
[\fB\-\-verifier\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB\-\-archive\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB\-\-headless\fR]
[\fB\-\-verify\-receipt\fR \fIHANDLE\fR]
[\fB\-\-export\-report\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB\-\-check\-origins\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B himvote
is the native Linux desktop client and cryptographic verifier for the HimVote
verifiable election platform. It allows student voters to browse active elections,
verify individual ballot inclusion receipts using RFC 9162 Merkle tree proofs,
and empowers independent auditors to inspect offline election archives (.zip,
\&.tar.gz, or directory) without trusted server assumptions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-base\fR \fIURL\fR
Set the institutional API base URL (default: http://localhost:8080).
.TP
\fB\-\-verifier\fR \fIPATH\fR
Specify path to the external standalone verifier script (default: verifier/verify.py).
.TP
\fB\-\-archive\fR \fIPATH\fR
Path to an offline election archive file (.zip, .tar.gz) or exported evidence directory.
.TP
\fB\-\-headless\fR
Execute in headless CLI mode without initializing an X11 or Wayland GUI display.
Useful for automated CI/CD and server verification pipelines.
.TP
\fB\-\-verify\-receipt\fR \fIHANDLE\fR
Verify inclusion proof for a specific receipt handle within the loaded archive.
.TP
\fB\-\-export\-report\fR \fIPATH\fR
Export reproducible audit report in Markdown (.md) or JSON (.json) format.
.TP
\fB\-\-check\-origins\fR
Perform connectivity and latency diagnostic health checks against configured origins.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Display command-line help message and exit.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+1 / Alt+1
Navigate to Elections Portal.
.TP
.B Ctrl+2 / Alt+2
Navigate to Cryptographic Receipt Verifier.
.TP
.B Ctrl+3 / Alt+3
Navigate to Offline Election Archive Audit Explorer.
.TP
.B Ctrl+4 / Alt+4
Navigate to Verification Architecture Explainer.
.TP
.B Ctrl+5 / Alt+5
Navigate to Security Limits & Institutional Trust Model.
.TP
.B Ctrl+6 / Alt+6
Navigate to Session & Identity Authentication Portal.
.TP
.B Ctrl+7 / Alt+7
Navigate to System Settings & Origin Endpoints.
.TP
.B Ctrl+8 / Alt+8
Navigate to Administrative Audit Log & Evidence Explorer.
.TP
.B Ctrl+H
Toggle WCAG 2.1 AAA High-Contrast Theme.
.TP
.B Ctrl+K / F1
Display Keyboard Shortcuts dialog.
